        <p>Yes. After your demo call we build your pipeline, move your records, and switch the AI agents on within 24 hours.</p></details>
      <details name="faq"><summary>What do free setup and migration include?<span class="ld-caret"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M216.49,104.49l-80,80a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-80-80a12,12,0,0,1,17-17L128,159l71.51-71.52a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z"/></svg></span></summary>
        <p>We set up your stages, fields, and follow-up rules, then move your contacts, deals, and history from spreadsheets, inboxes, or your current CRM. There is no setup fee.</p></details>
      <details name="faq"><summary>How does automatic follow-up work?<span class="ld-caret"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M216.49,104.49l-80,80a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-80-80a12,12,0,0,1,17-17L128,159l71.51-71.52a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z"/></svg></span></summary>
        <p>You set the rules, like when a quote should get a check-in. The follow-up agent sends it on time, every time, and re-engages leads that went quiet.</p></details>
      <details name="faq"><summary>What else do the AI agents do?<span class="ld-caret"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M216.49,104.49l-80,80a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-80-80a12,12,0,0,1,17-17L128,159l71.51-71.52a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z"/></svg></span></summary>
